ری کرتے ہیں،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "(Yaitu) orang-orang yang beriman dan mereka selalu bertakwa.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ءَامَنُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/e941c23e00d9a522f412.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "they believed", "bs": "povjerovali su", "tr": "inandılar", "fr": "ils ont cru", "id": "mereka telah beriman", "ur": "وہ ایمان لائے", "bn": "তারা ঈমান আনল", "fa": "ایمان آوردند"}}, {"text": "وَكَانُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَتَّقُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "77:50", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5672.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "In what statement, after this, will they believe?", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Artık bundan (Kur'an'dan) sonra hangi söze inanacaklar?", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "پھر اس کے بعد کون سی بات پر ایمان لائیں گے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Maka kepada perkataan apakah selain Al Quran ini mereka akan beriman?", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَبِأَىِّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "حَدِيثٍۭ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بَعْدَهُۥ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُؤْمِنُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/138da7ca339acdb5d677.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "povjerovat će", "en": "will they believe", "tr": "iman edecekler", "fr": "croiront-ils", "id": "mereka akan beriman", "ur": "ایمان لائیں گے", "bn": "তারা ঈমান আনবে", "fa": "ایمان خواهند آورد"}}]}, {"ref": "106:4", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/6197.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Who hath fed them against hunger and hath made them safe from fear.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "O, kendilerini açlıktan kurtararak beslemiştir ve her tehlikeye karşı onlara emniyet vermiştir.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "جس نے انہیں بھوک میں کھانا دیا، اور انہیں ایک بڑے خوف سے امان بخشا", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Yang telah memberi makanan kepada mereka untuk menghilangkan lapar dan mengamankan mereka dari ketakutan.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "ٱلَّذِىٓ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَطْعَمَهُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِّن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "جُوعٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَءَامَنَهُم", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/207e8b9a8c70be874032.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "and he/it made them safe", "bs": "i učinio ih je sigurnim", "tr": "böylece inandı", "fr": "et il les a mis en sûreté", "id": "dan dia telah menjadikan mereka aman", "ur": "اور اُس نے انہیں امن بخشا", "bn": "এবং তিনি তাদের নিরাপদ করলেন", "fa": "و آنان را ایمن گردانید"}}, {"text": "مِّنْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "خَوْفٍۭ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "7:121", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1075.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Crying: We believe in the Lord of the Worlds,", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "\"Âlemlerin Rabbine iman ettik.\" dediler.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "بولے ہم ایمان لائے جہان کے رب پر،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Mereka berkata: \"Kami beriman kepada Tuhan semesta alam,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "قَالُوٓا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ءَامَنَّا", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/2139ad6f87d0082bb93f.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "povjerovali smo", "en": "we believe", "tr": "iman ettik", "fr": "nous croyons", "id": "kami beriman", "ur": "ہم ایمان لائے", "bn": "আমরা ঈমান আনলাম", "fa": "ایمان آوردیم"}}, {"text": "بِرَبِّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "69:33", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5356.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Lo! He used not to believe in Allah the Tremendous,", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Çünkü o, büyük Allah'a inanmıyordu.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "بیشک وہ عظمت والے اللہ پر ایمان نہ لاتا تھا", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Sesungguhnya dia dahulu tidak beriman kepada Allah Yang Maha Besar.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "إِنَّهُۥ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كَانَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُؤْمِنُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/63a5e2f453ec4e8d96cd.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "he/it believes", "bs": "vjeruje", "tr": "inanır", "fr": "il croit", "id": "dia beriman", "ur": "وہ ایمان لاتا ہے", "bn": "সে ঈমান আনে", "fa": "ایمان می‌آورد"}}, {"text": "بِٱللَّهِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْعَظِيمِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "64:8", "tense": "imperative", "category": {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5207.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "So believe in Allah and His messenger and the light which We have revealed. And Allah is Informed of what ye do.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Artık Allah'a, Resulüne ve indirdiğimiz nura (Kur'ân'a) inanın. Allah yaptıklarınızdan haberdardır.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو ایمان لاؤ اللہ اور اس کے رسول اور اس نور پر جو ہم نے اتارا، اور اللہ تمہارے کاموں سے خبردار ہے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Maka berimanlah kamu kepada Allah dan Rasul-Nya dan kepada cahaya (Al-Quran) yang telah Kami turunkan. Dan Allah Maha Mengetahui apa yang kamu kerjakan.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَـَٔامِنُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/fa019a129a799168f3b7.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "pa vjerujte", "en": "so believe", "tr": "öyleyse iman edin", "fr": "croyez donc", "id": "maka berimanlah", "ur": "تو ایمان لاؤ", "bn": "অতএব ঈমান আন", "fa": "پس ایمان بیاورید"}}, {"text": "بِٱللَّهِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَرَسُولِهِۦ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱلنُّورِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِىٓ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَنزَلْنَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَعْمَلُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "خَبِيرٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "ءَامَنُوا۟", "count": 212, "first": "2:9", "audio": "audio/3d0c75a97189eb330fab.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "they believed", "bs": "povjerovali su", "tr": "inandılar", "fr": "ils ont cr